,-0.01828102,0.18919203,-0.04212683,0.01403191,0.0026027,-0.01321743,-0.00408992,0.06901952,0.04400827,-0.00026283,-0.00240444,0.09932233,-0.01811492,-0.01232968,0.05621318,-0.02366254,-0.03261453,-0.05305787,-0.02501784,0.03799105,0.00026365,0.00427725,-0.03752714,0.13796873,-0.00272137,-0.02407526,-0.08179224,-0.01371603,-0.01428558,-0.01097293,0.00169535,0.012263,-0.03276766,0.03710464,-0.04815287,0.0137322,0.03602985,-0.03301312,-0.00654442,-0.00583476,0.00170025,-0.00063241,0.11856565,-0.03186608],"last_embed":{"hash":"6easqb","tokens":473}}},"last_read":{"hash":"6easqb","at":1774939652649},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939638329,"size":5865,"at":1774939651537,"hash":"6easqb"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning":[20,42],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#{1}":[21,25],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/4VJRBUCH","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/NLWWRUR9?page=1&annotation=9B6HPXEX","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 2","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/NLWWRUR9?page=2&annotation=LZVS4EE4","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/NLWWRUR9?page=1&annotation=L2JVFGFB","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 3","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/NLWWRUR9?page=3&annotation=XMYJBL3G","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/NLWWRUR9?page=1&annotation=E4MBZPLR","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 3","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/NLWWRUR9?page=3&annotation=U8996XRV","line":39}],"metadata":{"Title":"A pilot study of the potential role of ChatGPT in stated-calorie diet planning","Authors":"Serkan Aslan, Saniye Sozlu","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1038/s41366-025-01839-w","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"This study used ChatGPT version 3.5, freely available to the public. ChatGPT was instructed to generate daily diet plans with 1500, 2000, and 2500 calories as well as recipes with 300, 500, and 700 calories (four distinct recipe prompts were utilized for each calorie group). The calories of the resulting recipes and diet plans were calculated using nutrition databases and compared with the actual value.Recipes and a daily diet plan were created with specific prompts (such as the amount of calories and the food we wanted to include in the recipe). The foods we specified in the recipe prompts (potatoes, spinach, and beef) were chosen because they are widely consumed in many food cultures and represent both animal and plant-based nutrition","Findings":"Only prompt-2 in the 500-calorie group showed a significant change (p < 0.05), although there was no significant difference in the four distinct recipe prompts in the 300, 500, and 700-calorie groups (p > 0.05). Among the diet plans provided by ChatGPT, there was no significant difference between the values of the 2500-calorie group and the actual calorie values in the control group (p > 0.05).In this study, the daily diet plan requested three different calories (1500, 2000, and 2500 calories); only the results of the 2500-calorie group were found to be consistent with the actual calorie values (p > 0.05). This result shows that the success rate of ChatGPT in creating a daily nutrition plan with a more complex structure decreases compared to creating a meal recipe.","Conclusions":"According to these results, ChatGPT is more successful in creating recipe with the desired calories than daily diet planning. In this study, the calorie values of the diet plans and recipes provided by ChatGPT have demonstrated significant potential with their closeness to actual valuOne significant study restriction is that users who wish to consult ChatGPT regarding nutrition may submit prompts in various forms, and ChatGPT may respond differently to each prompt variation. One of the limitations of the study is that recipes cannot be examined according to the different food cultures of countries. Individual differences may affect an individual’s benefit from ChatGPT. In addition, the study’s originality prevents the generalization of the results.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"6easqb","at":1774939652473}},"smart_blocks:aslanPilotStudyPotential2025.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[0.00835411,0.02278206,-0.01149008,0.00163399,-0.0433481,0.03307265,-0.06888888,0.05836675,-0.00004408,0.00346301,0.01791862,-0.08879431,0.07153516,0.05931335,0.04521002,-0.00765233,-0.00082393,-0.08347593,-0.04833916,0.02896199,0.0788331,-0.07557833,0.02203278,-0.01403577,0.05412317,0.01239799,-0.04476449,-0.03443887,-0.047677,-0.22206236,0.01721841,0.01911313,0.06313618,-0.